le werkomgeving.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"313\" data-end=\"322\">Staat</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"323\" data-end=\"341\"><strong data-start=\"323\" data-end=\"341\">In Nette Staat</strong></p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"343\" data-end=\"358\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"539\">\r\n<li data-start=\"359\" data-end=\"412\">\r\n<p data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"412\">⭐ Actieve studiomonitor met ingebouwde versterker</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"458\">\r\n<p data-start=\"415\" data-end=\"458\">⭐ Geschikt voor muziekproductie en mixing</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"459\" data-end=\"492\">\r\n<p data-start=\"461\" data-end=\"492\">⭐ Nauwkeurige geluidsweergave</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"493\" data-end=\"539\">\r\n<p data-start=\"495\" data-end=\"539\">⭐ Compact formaat voor studio-opstellingen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"541\" data-end=\"561\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"792\">\r\n<li data-start=\"562\" data-end=\"606\">\r\n<p data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"606\"><strong data-start=\"564\" data-end=\"581\">Merk & model:</strong> KRK Systems ROKIT 4 G3</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"607\" data-end=\"642\">\r\n<p data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"642\"><strong data-start=\"609\" data-end=\"618\">Type:</strong> Actieve studiomonitor</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"643\" data-end=\"665\">\r\n<p data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"665\"><strong data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"656\">Woofer:</strong> 4 inch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"666\" data-end=\"689\">\r\n<p data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"689\"><strong data-start=\"668\" data-end=\"681\">Vermogen:</strong> ± 30W</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"727\">\r\n<p data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"727\"><strong data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"711\">Connectiviteit:</strong> XLR, TRS, RCA</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"762\">\r\n<p data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"762\"><strong data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"740\">Kleur:</strong> Niet gespecificeerd</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"792\">\r\n<p data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"792\"><strong data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"775\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"812\">📦 Meegeleverd</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"824\">\r\n<li data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"824\">\r\n<p data-start=\"815\" data-end=\"824\">Monitor</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"848\">🛡️ Incl. Garantie</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"881\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>",
